    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2019_0464","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Bartholomew Zielińska talks about drawing with a ladder. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
